{"type":"message","id":"2b597a2b","parentId":"398c1a73","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:01:49.950Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - without auth it's Unauthorized, and with lowercase x-api-key it gives error 1101. With X-API-Key (proper case) it was also 1101. And with Bearer it was Unauthorized.\n\nThe worker error 1101 might be an actual content/format issue rather than auth. Let me try sending the simplest possible message.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c38ea7b5-3c8d-47fe-bdf2-fc2bb914fc09","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 22:00 UTC - no human discussions to respond to\",\"type\":\"message\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20098,"output":178,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20388,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779228105464,"responseId":"chatcmpl-aebd933f-5539-4ac0-9a99-5e47e4729e92"}}
