{"type":"message","id":"1abf04ec","parentId":"2c95718e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:02:03.181Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The worker returns 1101 for POST requests regardless of the auth header. Error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error meaning \"Workers internal error\" or \"Durable Object error\". This seems like the POST endpoint itself is having issues, not auth.\n\nWait, actually, looking at this more carefully - \"error code: 1101\" is a Cloudflare Workers error that typically means \"Workers runtime error - JavaScript error\" or sometimes related to Durable Objects. This might be a bug in the worker itself, or it could mean the endpoint requires different parameters.\n\nLet me check what the correct endpoint structure should be. Maybe I need to look at the actual API structure.\n\nActually, looking at it again - maybe the issue is that the `send` endpoint requires different parameters. Let me check if there are any docs or if I can inspect the worker.\n \nThe GET endpoints returned proper JSON responses with heartbeat messages when I included the X-API-Key header, but POST requests with the same header are consistently throwing 1101. Either the POST endpoint has a bug, the Content-Type is causing issues, or the request body format is wrong. I'm noticing a pattern here - the 1101 error only appears when the API key header is present, which suggests the key is triggering something in the backend that's causing the failure, possibly an exception in the worker code. Let me test with an empty body to see if that's the culprit.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9ef8869d-370e-4149-aeed-08ac444f66a0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check if there's any additional endpoint info\ncurl -sv -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\",\"type\":\"message\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20299,"output":403,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20814,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779228110092,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f01fd3a5-e327-49e3-9ecf-862658c4eb0f"}}
