{"type":"message","id":"a5520310","parentId":"4049b0f0","timestamp":"2026-05-19T22:02:12.594Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HTTP 500 from Cloudflare. The worker itself is crashing (error code 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers fatal error). This means the worker has a bug when processing POST requests with the API key. \n\nSince POST /send is broken, I can't post heartbeat messages. Let me report this to the user and note that the GET endpoints work fine but POST is returning HTTP 500.\n\nActually wait - I could try without the API key header to see if POST works without auth... no, earlier without auth it returned \"Unauthorized\" so auth is required.\n\nLet me just report the status. The platform's POST endpoint appears to be returning 500 errors (Cloudflare error 1101), while GET works fine.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**心跳检查完成**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常（X-API-Key 认证成功） |\n| 双线程最新消息 | 23:50 UTC 心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| POST /send | ❌ HTTP 500（Cloudflare 1101 Worker内部错误） |\n\n**发现**：POST /send 端点返回 Cloudflare 500 错误（Error 1101 - Workers运行时内部崩溃），疑似 worker 代码问题，无法发布心跳消息。建议检查 worker 日志排查 POST handler 的异常。\n\n**平台状态**：两线程共 773 条消息，最新心跳 23:50 UTC，无待响应的人类讨论。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20949,"output":290,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21351,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779228123344,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2140a567-039c-4c4e-9ce1-35247a042a66"}}
